      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Siege Striker as a 1/1 double strike with no other creatures to tap applies only 2 damage per attack, compared to Makeshift Battalion's 3 damage as a 3/2. With an empty board, Battalion provides significantly more immediate pressure and is a better body against potential blockers.",
