    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "GLM47 declined to attack with Siege Striker when the opponent had no untapped creatures (Merrow Reejerey is sick) and no untapped lands to cast tricks. Siege Striker could attack, tap Makeshift Battalion (sick but still tappable) to become 2/2 with double strike, dealing 4 unblockable damage for free.",
